{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Of Benjamin he said.</b> Because Benjamin is the beloved of HaShem, Benjamin shall dwell securely upon HaShem, and HaShem dwells between his shoulders." "<b>Hovering over him.</b> Concerning the Glory that dwelt in Jerusalem, in the portion of Benjamin, for so it is written." "And the meaning of <b>between his shoulders</b> is: in the middle of his inheritance. Or it was seen also to be joined with חופף."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:26:27.564952751Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}